{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜APEC記者會／立法會討論為政府僱員提供家庭友善措施\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261116.png\"><p>【Now新聞台】APEC領導人會議周，新聞中心今日(11月16日)下午在深圳舉行兩場記者會。同日，立法會公務員及資助機構員工事務委員會開會，討論為政府僱員提供家庭友善僱傭措施。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:00:41.573205+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T23:21:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:29:54.450353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T23:54:14.038425+00:00","content_hash":"eb3cd165cf234063e74dc12c49a34897ad5a841221a1133e05d7e128977d5c8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:00:41.573205+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}